  "payload": {
    "subject": "修复 getAppContext() stub 缺少 getDefaultTheme 导致按钮权限不显示",
    "context": "#004",
    "content": "## 问题\n\n```\napplytheme.js:5 Uncaught TypeError: appContext.theme.getDefaultTheme is not a function\n    at applytheme.js:5:66\n```\n\n## 根因\n\n`util.js:72` 的嵌入式降级 stub 中 `theme` 对象缺少 `getDefaultTheme` 方法：\n\n```javascript\n// 当前 stub (util.js:72)\ntheme: { applyTheme: function(){} }\n```\n\n`applytheme.js:5` 调用链：\n```javascript\nappContext.theme.applyThemeToTarget(window, appContext.theme.getDefaultTheme());\n```\n\n`getDefaultTheme` 不存在 → 抛异常 → 可能阻断后续按钮权限初始化。\n\n## 修复\n\n参照 `appContext.js:176-180` 原实现，stub 补充 `getDefaultTheme` 和 `applyThemeToTarget`：\n\n```javascript\n// 改前\ntheme: { applyTheme: function(){} }\n\n// 改后\ntheme: {\n    applyTheme: function(){},\n    applyThemeToTarget: function(){},\n    getDefaultTheme: function() {\n        return JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(\"theme\") || \"null\") || {};\n    }\n}\n```\n\n> 如果 `optionalThemes()` 可访问就用它做 fallback，否则 `{}` 即可。",
    "files": [
      "caikuangzi.fenluwebproject/trunk/Web/Web/v2/util.js"
    ],
    "actions": [
      "util.js getAppContext() stub 的 theme 对象补充 getDefaultTheme 和 applyThemeToTarget 方法",
      "SVN 暂存",
      "发送 REVIEW 给 Reviewer"
    ],
    "deadline": null
  }
}
